      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0011",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code shows how you can create a custom timing function using [`simd_smoothstep(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/simd/simd_smoothstep(_:_:_:)-5839l) interpolation:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code shows how you can create a custom timing function using [`simd_smoothstep(_:_:_:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/simd/simd_smoothstep(_:_:_:)-5839l) interpolation:",
