      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The return [`SKActionTimingFunction`](skactiontimingfunction.md) value of the timing function determines the actual time used to perform the animation.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nimport simd\nlet horizontalAction = SKAction.moveTo(x: end.x, duration: 2.0)\nhorizontalAction.timingFunction = {\n    time in\n    return simd_smoothstep(0, 1, time)\n}\n```",
